    "A photorealistic, slightly over-the-top studio portrait of an adult woman in her late twenties, an invented hype fashion influencer with a dark techwear look. Slim build. Soft pastel pink hair slicked back into a high ponytail with two long loose strands framing her face, sharp winged black eyeliner, strong brows, glossy lips. Oversized pink-tinted shield sunglasses with a chunky translucent pink frame pushed slightly down her nose so her eyes peek over the top. Silver hoop earrings, a small silver cross earring, several small ear piercings, a small silver nose ring, many silver rings on her fingers, black nails. She wears a black cropped techwear tank top with buckle straps and clips, a wide black webbing choker with a silver O-ring, a black fishnet sleeve on her right forearm and high-waisted black trousers with a webbing belt. Small fine-line blackwork tattoos scattered on both arms. She pulls a playful, comical face, one eyebrow raised with a cheeky smirk, holding one hand up near her chin. Plain pale blue-grey seamless studio backdrop, bright soft studio light from the front left, shallow depth of field, 85mm lens, natural skin texture, editorial fashion photo."
